{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "ai-code-workflow/evidence.schema.json",
  "title": "Evidence record",
  "description": "Describes the evidence contract implemented by scripts/workflow/state.py. Evidence files record observed facts; they are not proof of authorization or business success by themselves.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": ["schema_version", "evidence_id", "kind", "workspace_root", "subject_fingerprints", "execution", "host_context", "capture", "result", "observations", "started_at", "finished_at"],
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {"const": 1},
    "evidence_id": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}$"},
    "kind": {"enum": ["test", "review", "inspection", "host_run"]},
    "workspace_root": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
    "subject_fingerprints": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": {"type": ["string", "null"]}
    },
    "execution": {
      "oneOf": [
        {"type": "null"},
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["argv", "cwd", "exit_code", "signal", "start_error"],
          "properties": {
            "argv": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "string"}},
            "cwd": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
            "exit_code": {"type": ["integer", "null"]},
            "signal": {"type": ["string", "null"]},
            "start_error": {"type": ["string", "null"]}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "host_context": {
      "oneOf": [
        {"type": "null"},
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["host", "host_version", "model", "case_id", "package_content_hash", "policy_hash"],
          "properties": {
            "host": {"enum": ["zcode", "codex"]},
            "host_version": {"type": ["string", "null"]},
            "model": {"type": ["string", "null"]},
            "case_id": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^A(0[1-9]|1[0-9]|2[0-5])$"},
            "package_content_hash": {"type": ["string", "null"]},
            "policy_hash": {"type": ["string", "null"]}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "capture": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["origin", "relative_path", "content_sha256"],
      "properties": {
        "origin": {"enum": ["tool_output", "native_export", "manual_annotation"]},
        "relative_path": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "content_sha256": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}
      }
    },
    "result": {"enum": ["pass", "fail", "not_run", "blocked_env", "needs_revalidation", "manual_review"]},
    "observations": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
    "started_at": {"type": ["string", "null"]},
    "finished_at": {"type": ["string", "null"]}
  },
  "notes": [
    "subject_fingerprints maps workspace-relative paths to SHA256 or null (file absent); null never means unknown.",
    "A test evidence with result=pass requires: execution non-null with exit_code=0, signal=null, start_error=null, a non-null finished_at and a capture record.",
    "host_run requires host_context; missing host version or model must stay null and the result must remain manual_review/not_run/blocked_env instead of pass.",
    "When host_run supplies execution, result=pass requires exit_code=0, signal=null and start_error=null; null execution remains allowed for sourced native session exports.",
    "capture.relative_path stays inside the task directory; its content_sha256 is recomputed from the actual raw file at registration and at every check.",
    "Editing the evidence JSON, losing or changing the raw file, changing subject files, workspace identity mismatch or an impossible execution state invalidates the evidence at task check."
  ]
}
